{"3343350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pitfalls 64", "steam_appid": 3343350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>MEET THE CAST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras/6fafa772e947936ebf46b025b04f2788.avif?t=1788257822\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras_big/6fafa772e947936ebf46b025b04f2788.webp?t=1788257822 width=1560 height=750 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Pitfalls 64&quot;</i></strong> is a brutally challenging collectathon about a homesick gnome in search of his way back home! This punishing journey will demand full mastery of acrobatic jumping. Just remember, with each bonk back down there is a lesson to be told...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras/3cc39751d32f69074cc5ede70828cf60.avif?t=1788257822\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras_big/3cc39751d32f69074cc5ede70828cf60.webp?t=1788257822 width=1560 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras/c0344bd54b1257c2b19a78821865570a.poster.avif?t=1788257822\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras/c0344bd54b1257c2b19a78821865570a.webm?t=1788257822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras/c0344bd54b1257c2b19a78821865570a.mp4?t=1788257822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You'll be fighting the climb home! </strong></i>Each butt-clenching jump raises the stakes; a single slip sends you tumbling back down, and you're the only one who can pick yourself back up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras/812d098b36cdf846780d154728a24047.avif?t=1788257822\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras_big/812d098b36cdf846780d154728a24047.webp?t=1788257822 width=1560 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras/6061692d80a41d418df8a11cf2879bb9.poster.avif?t=1788257822\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras/6061692d80a41d418df8a11cf2879bb9.webm?t=1788257822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras/6061692d80a41d418df8a11cf2879bb9.mp4?t=1788257822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Don't give up little gnome! </strong></i>With a little bit of practice you'll become a master of acrobatic jumping in no time - after all, falling is half the fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras/375241d0a90113af91a311eaca67046c.avif?t=1788257822\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343350/extras_big/375241d0a90113af91a311eaca67046c.webp?t=1788257822 width=1560 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi